---
// src/components/FeaturedProjects.astro
// Flagship Projects Showcase for Faycal Rafa Portfolio
// 5 authoritative projects with compact layout, edge-to-edge clean screenshots, and zero ugly nested cards
---

<section id="projects" class="relative py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-950/30">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-500/20 bg-blue-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:border-blue-400/20 dark:bg-blue-400/10 dark:text-blue-400">
        <span>Featured Engineering Work</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-zinc-50">
        Projects I Participated In
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Flagship software systems spanning native Android applications, multi-tenant e-commerce architectures, mission-critical fintech payments, and real-time electronic trading simulators.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Flagship Projects Showcase with Animated Progress Laser -->
    <div class="relative mt-12 projects-timeline-container pl-6 sm:pl-10 md:pl-14">
      
      <!-- Vertical Continuous Line Connector Base -->
      <div
        class="absolute left-2 sm:left-4 md:left-5 top-6 bottom-6 w-0.5 bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>

      <!-- Vertical Glowing Laser Progress Line -->
      <div
        id="projects-progress-laser"
        class="absolute left-2 sm:left-4 md:left-5 top-6 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500 via-indigo-500 to-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(59,130,246,0.6)] transition-all duration-150"
        style="height: 0%;"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>

      <div class="space-y-10 sm:space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Project 1: BookReader Pro (Current Free-to-Use Flagship Android App) -->
      <article class="project-timeline-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/90 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-500/40 hover:shadow-xl dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:hover:border-amber-500/30">
        <!-- Timeline Node Beacon -->
        <div
          class="project-beacon absolute -left-6 sm:-left-10 md:-left-14 top-8 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 h-5 w-5 bg-amber-500 ring-4 ring-amber-500/20 shadow-md shadow-amber-500/30"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Text Meta Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:border-amber-400/30 dark:bg-amber-400/10 dark:text-amber-400">
                  <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  Flagship App • Free to Use
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Android Native
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
                BookReader Pro
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
                On-Device AI Neural Audio &amp; Offline Novel Reader
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                A private, 100% free offline reader pairing on-device neural TTS with uninterrupted background audio playback and zero cloud dependency.
              </p>

              <!-- Role & Impact Bullets (Concise & Punchy) -->
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 shrink-0">Role:</span>
                  <span>Solo Creator &amp; Lead Android Engineer. Built complete Kotlin M3 UI, C++ neural model runtime, and AndroidX Media3 background service.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0">Impact:</span>
                  <span>Shipped Kokoro 82M &amp; Piper on-device TTS with zero telemetry, surviving aggressive Android background battery killers.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <!-- Tech Stack Tags -->
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="BookReader tech stack">
                {['Kotlin', 'Jetpack Compose', 'AndroidX Media3', 'Kokoro TTS', 'Piper C++', 'Scoped Storage'].map(tech => (
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-100/90 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 dark:text-zinc-300">
                    {tech}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action CTAs -->
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800/60">
              <a
                href="/projects/bookreader"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-colors"
              >
                <span>Flagship Showcase</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </a>

              <a
                href="https://github.com/faycalrafa/free-novel-reader-tts-android/releases/tag/v3.4.0"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-colors"
              >
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 3a.75.75 0 01.75.75v8.69l2.22-2.22a.75.75 0 111.06 1.06l-3.5 3.5a.75.75 0 01-1.06 0l-3.5-3.5a.75.75 0 111.06-1.06l2.22 2.22V3.75A.75.75 0 0110 3z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  <path d="M3.75 16.5A.75.75 0 003 17.25c0 .414.336.75.75.75h12.5a.75.75 0 00.75-.75.75.75 0 00-.75-.75H3.75z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Download APK (v3.4.0)</span>
              </a>

              <a
                href="https://github.com/faycalrafa/free-novel-reader-tts-android"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors"
              >
                <span>GitHub Repo</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Clean Edge-to-Edge Screenshot Column (No ugly nested gradient card) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-first lg:order-last">
            <img
              src="/images/bookreader/screenshot-01-home.jpg"
              alt="BookReader Pro Android App Screenshot"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full max-w-[220px] sm:max-w-[250px] rounded-2xl shadow-xl ring-1 ring-zinc-800/80 object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-102"
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 2: StoresDZ (Shopify, but open and built for Algeria) -->
      <article class="project-timeline-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/90 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:shadow-xl dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30">
        <!-- Timeline Node Beacon -->
        <div
          class="project-beacon absolute -left-6 sm:-left-10 md:-left-14 top-8 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 h-4 w-4 bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-white dark:border-zinc-900"
          data-active-class="bg-blue-500 ring-4 ring-blue-500/20 shadow-md shadow-blue-500/30"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Text Meta Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:border-blue-400/30 dark:bg-blue-400/10 dark:text-blue-400">
                  <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  Multi-Tenant Platform
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Shopify for Algeria
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">
                StoresDZ
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
                Full-Stack Multi-Tenant E-Commerce Platform
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                Think Shopify, but open and built for Algeria — powering localized custom storefronts, sales funnels, and cash-on-delivery tracking.
              </p>

              <!-- Role & Impact Bullets -->
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 shrink-0">Role:</span>
                  <span>Fullstack Engineer. Connected merchant storefronts to commerce microservices, built reusable theme primitives, and localized checkout workflows.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0">Impact:</span>
                  <span>Delivered multi-tenant architecture supporting 7 distinct industry themes, shared commerce APIs, and high-velocity order management.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <!-- Tech Stack Tags -->
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="StoresDZ tech stack">
                {['TypeScript', 'React', 'Go', 'Rust', 'Redis', 'Docker'].map(tech => (
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-100/90 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 dark:text-zinc-300">
                    {tech}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action CTAs -->
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800/60">
              <a
                href="/projects/storesdz"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-colors"
              >
                <span>View Architecture</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </a>

              <a
                href="https://saadisidali.github.io/shan-shui-portfolio/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors"
              >
                <span>Live Reference</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M11 3h6v6" /><path d="M10 10l7-7" /><path d="M17 11v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h6" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Clean Edge-to-Edge Screenshot Column (No ugly nested gradient card) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-first lg:order-last">
            <img
              src="/images/projects/storesdz/theme-default.jpg"
              alt="StoresDZ Multi-Tenant E-Commerce Platform Theme Screenshot"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full max-w-md lg:max-w-none rounded-2xl shadow-xl ring-1 ring-zinc-800/80 object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-102"
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 3: SABIL Mega-App -->
      <article class="project-timeline-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/90 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:shadow-xl dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:hover:border-emerald-500/30">
        <!-- Timeline Node Beacon -->
        <div
          class="project-beacon absolute -left-6 sm:-left-10 md:-left-14 top-8 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 h-4 w-4 bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-white dark:border-zinc-900"
          data-active-class="bg-emerald-500 ring-4 ring-emerald-500/20 shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/30"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Text Meta Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:border-emerald-400/30 dark:bg-emerald-400/10 dark:text-emerald-400">
                  <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  Fintech &amp; Payments
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Consumer Mega-App
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors">
                SABIL Mega-App
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                Multi-Channel Mobile Banking, QR Payments &amp; Financial Microservices
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                National financial ecosystem powering instant QR merchant payments, utility bill settlements, and high-frequency digital wallets.
              </p>

              <!-- Role & Impact Bullets -->
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 shrink-0">Role:</span>
                  <span>Senior Software Engineer. Architected high-throughput NestJS microservices, payment orchestration engines, and PostgreSQL partitioning.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0">Impact:</span>
                  <span>Engineered resilient workflows with sub-45ms P99 latencies, zero reconciliation loss, and automated multi-channel settlement.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <!-- Tech Stack Tags -->
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="SABIL tech stack">
                {['NestJS', 'TypeScript', 'PostgreSQL', 'Docker', 'Redis', 'Microservices'].map(tech => (
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-100/90 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 dark:text-zinc-300">
                    {tech}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action CTAs -->
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800/60">
              <a
                href="/projects/sabil"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-colors"
              >
                <span>View Architecture</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </a>

              <a
                href="https://sabil.dz/en/getapp/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors"
              >
                <span>sabil.dz App</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M11 3h6v6" /><path d="M10 10l7-7" /><path d="M17 11v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h6" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Clean Edge-to-Edge Screenshot Column (No ugly nested gradient card) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-first lg:order-last">
            <img
              src="/images/projects/sabil/1.webp"
              alt="SABIL Mega-App Mobile Application Interface"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full max-w-[220px] sm:max-w-[250px] rounded-2xl shadow-xl ring-1 ring-zinc-800/80 object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-102"
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 4: InvestMarket (Standalone Project at Finnetude) -->
      <article class="project-timeline-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-white/90 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-indigo-500/40 hover:shadow-xl dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:hover:border-indigo-500/30">
        <!-- Timeline Node Beacon -->
        <div
          class="project-beacon absolute -left-6 sm:-left-10 md:-left-14 top-8 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 h-4 w-4 bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-white dark:border-zinc-900"
          data-active-class="bg-indigo-500 ring-4 ring-indigo-500/20 shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/30"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Text Meta Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:border-indigo-400/30 dark:bg-indigo-400/10 dark:text-indigo-400">
                  <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  Financial Platform &amp; Brokerage
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  COSOB Accredited
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-indigo-500 transition-colors">
                InvestMarket
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">
                Outil de gestion de portefeuille et d'analyse de performance boursière
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
                Plateforme financière institutionnelle développée chez Finnetude pour la négociation de titres, la valorisation de portefeuilles en temps réel et l'analyse de performance boursière.
              </p>

              <!-- Role & Impact Bullets -->
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 shrink-0">Role:</span>
                  <span>Technical Lead (Finnetude &amp; InvestMarket). Co-architected orderbook routing, streaming market feeds, and PostgreSQL database models.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0">Impact:</span>
                  <span>Passerelles WebSockets temps réel, conformité COSOB, pattern Transactional Outbox, et -65 % de requêtes base grâce à la mise en cache Redis.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <!-- Tech Stack Tags -->
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="InvestMarket tech stack">
                {['NestJS', 'TypeScript', 'WebSockets', 'PostgreSQL', 'Redis', 'Docker'].map(tech => (
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-100/90 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 dark:text-zinc-300">
                    {tech}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action CTAs -->
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800/60">
